[sliver] Vertical side of the 6.4 mm wide permanent rib foot. The 1.2 mm strip is the height of its flat bed-contact land; above it the stock tapers inward at 45 degrees into the 2.4 mm rib. The full width rests on the bed in print orientation, and the transverse air channels remain open.
